phi-adapter-fritz (0.0~git202609081315.4a1658d-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Channel values reported during a poll wait for that poll's descriptor. A
    poll is where the instance learns what the router implements, so the
    channel a value belongs to may not exist yet, or may still carry the type
    it had before - and phi-core drops or misreads it without the adapter
    hearing about it.

